## Method (simulated rewind)

Per PitrTimelineCheckTest:
1. seed QUEUED, claim worker-stale (token tA), issueCap epoch 1.
2. Rewind: UPDATE jobs SET QUEUED/NULL owner/fencing_token=tA-1/NULL lease;
   DELETE rewound attempt + cap_grants row.
   Gap: audit_events/job_checkpoints NOT rewound (append-only, TRUNCATE-only);
   PG timeline ID NOT bumped (real PITR would bump timeline + rewind all tables).
3. Attempt stale heartbeat/commit; fresh claim; commit without cap; re-issue;
   commit; ledger check. Timeline lookup via pg_control_checkpoint().

